      "description": "If 120 rpm is the speed before the motor adds 75 rpm, the measured steady speed is 195 rpm and the required power is 0.483083696 W; if the motor previously increased the speed from 45 rpm to the stated measurement speed of 120 rpm, the required power is 0.182942938 W."
